==Trivia==
*The Shiny Rare print has an error where diagonal lines overlay the main body of the card.
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crown Zenith|Oddish|1}} from the {{TCG|Crown Zenith}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Oddish}}.
*{{m|Poison Powder}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Oddish}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

